Provide an optional resolvconf package with a symlink to resolvectl.

This allows removing resolvconf while maintaining compatibility with
scripts and programs that utilize it.

Index: systemd/debian/control
===================================================================
--- systemd.orig/debian/control
+++ systemd/debian/control
@@ -569,3 +569,12 @@
  are different from the libsystemd's and libudev's pkg-config files, which can
  still be found in the respective dev packages, but instead provide data such as
  the installation directories for units, and more.
+
+Package: systemd-resolvconf
+Section: admin
+Architecture: amd64 arm64 i386 armhf
+Priority: optional
+Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
+         ${misc:Depends},
+         systemd-resolved
+Description: Empty transitional package (can be safely removed).
